  "title": "Bit Digital Inc. Continues Expansion of Ethereum Holdings to Approximately 120,000 ETH, Reinforcing Treasury Strategy",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), today announced that it has purchased approximately 19,683 Ethereum (“ETH”) using the net proceeds from its recently completed $67.3 million registered direct offering to institutional investors. Following the transaction, Bit Digital holds approximately 120,306 ETH.",
